INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:214 autonomous activation actor=cestia turn=1 phase=diplomacy tool_calls=send_message,send_message,save_note,ready
INFO     app.api:api.py:340 GET /admin/games/db54f331-9610-45fb-86a7-175cc95b2b98/export -> 200 (3.9ms)
