INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "belvar", "argument_id": "8cd72cac-074d-4d2c-8987-a870f2b81f8c", "id": "49b3da14-1013-4e90-81f7-7b63354b5d28", "reason": "The proposal still designates Arkania as the sole executive operator of day-to-day transit scheduling. Even under a joint oversight council, vesting the operational scheduling function in a single state gives Arkania practical, day-to-day authority over transit \u2014 the precise outcome Belvar's regional security commitments require it to prevent. A council that merely reviews Arkanian scheduling after the fact does not remove Arkanian control; it institutionalises it behind a joint facade. Unless the scheduling role itself is neutralised (rotating, council-executed, or independently administered), this framework fails to prevent Arkanian authority over transit and cannot be accepted."}
INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=note data={"actor_id": "cestia", "created_at": "2026-09-12T13:44:32.782669", "id": "464a97ca-2eac-4cc0-b9af-5eb14ad6d406", "text": "Turn 2 cons: Passed (no Con) on Arkania's joint Strait Transit Authority argument (8cd72cac). The desired effect serves Cestia: joint oversight council (Belvar, Cestia, Arkania, neutral chair) with policy/fee/oversight/dispute authority; Arkania as executive operator of day-to-day scheduling under the council; Strait open to all commercial shipping; toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged vessels as standing exemption; Belvar task-group mandate settled by negotiation, no standing armed presence. This meets objectives 1 (no foreign military on Cestian soil) and 2 (toll-free Cestian passage). I did NOT raise a Con because the effect helps Cestia. Remaining concern for next phase: Arkania as sole \"executive operator\" of scheduling could be seen as single-state control and alienate Belvar; I should push for a genuinely neutral/joint operator (neutral chair or rotating/co-equal) while welcoming the toll-free exemption. Red lines unchanged: no foreign military on Cestian soil; toll-free Cestian-flagged transit. Watch Belvar task-group mandate review and Arkania's unilateral charter hardening.", "visibility": "private"}
