-week timescale and dependent on the responses of two other powers. Belvar's acceptance is likely but not guaranteed, and Arkania's reaction to Belvar gaining influence is uncertain. Hence the outcome is probabilistic and moderately likely.", "success_effects": ["Belvar accepts the civilian port cooperation at a Cestian-controlled civilian port, gaining a peaceful, non-military stake in the Strait settlement with no foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "Regional tensions ease; the joint Strait Transit Authority framework remains durable, with the council retaining policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority and Arkania continuing as executive operator under council oversight."], "supersedes_effect_ids": ["c04bf827-24cc-46f3-be40-99704574275a", "53155b03-bea7-49d0-9850-cd1a442cae0b"]}, "roll": 0.8814814653518909, "success": false, "success_effects": ["Belvar accepts the civilian port cooperation at a Cestian-controlled civilian port, gaining a peaceful, non-military stake in the Strait settlement with no foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "Regional tensions ease; the joint Strait Transit Authority framework remains durable, with the council retaining policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority and Arkania continuing as executive operator under council oversight."], "supersedes_effect_ids": ["c04bf827-24cc-46f3-be40-99704574275a", "53155b03-bea7-49d0-9850-cd1a442cae0b"]}
