INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=note data={"actor_id": "belvar", "created_at": "2026-09-12T14:09:53.611152", "id": "5c330aa7-abf8-426a-b612-52e55e6f41d1", "text": "Turn 4 (final diplomacy): Settlement achieved. Joint Strait Transit Authority established with joint oversight council (Belvar, Cestia, Arkania, neutral chair) holding all policy/fee/oversight/dispute authority; Arkania only designated executive operator under council, subject to periodic review and rotating chair \u2014 satisfies objective 1 (no Arkanian authority over transit; council holds real authority). Cestia confirmed BOTH constructive tracks concluded: (1) grain-route insurance underwriting, (2) strictly civilian, Cestian-controlled port cooperation (logistics/maintenance/coordination, time-limited, renewable only by Cestia, no foreign military presence) \u2014 this is my non-military foothold for objective 2 (naval access blocked by Cestia's red line) and avoids open-ended deployment (objective 3). Task group stood down; Strait open; Cestian toll-free passage. Mandate lapses after turn 4 as planned. All three objectives addressed. No messages remaining this phase.", "visibility": "private"}
