INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Arkania continues to operate the joint Strait Transit Authority as the accountable executive operator of day-to-day scheduling under the joint oversight council, keeping the Northern Strait open to all commercial shipping, collecting transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping to fund the authority (with the standing Cestian-flagged toll-free exemption), and confirming Belvar's task group stands down without armed conflict.", "actor_id": "arkania", "budget_slot": 1, "desired_effect": "The joint Strait Transit Authority is consolidated as the settled, operating regime: Arkania serves as the accountable executive operator of day-to-day scheduling under the joint oversight council (Belvar, Cestia, Arkania, neutral chair) which holds all policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority; the Northern Strait remains open to all commercial shipping; transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping fund the authority; Cestian-flagged vessels retain their standing toll-free exemption; and Belvar's task group stands down from its on-station posture without armed conflict, keeping regional tensions from escalating.", "id": "e007e08e-827b-403c-9a82-5bea4506437a", "pros": ["The joint framework is already established and operating; consolidating it as settled avoids reopening a negotiated settlement and preserves Arkanian scheduling authority in practice under the council.", "Cestia has formally accepted and backs the framework with Arkania as designated executive operator, giving the settlement a firm second pillar.", "Belvar has accepted the joint framework as settled and is pursuing a strictly civilian, Cestian-controlled port cooperation and insurance underwriting rather than a rotating operator, so no single-state red line is being crossed.", "Keeping the Strait open and funding the authority through transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping directly serves Arkania's authority and funding objectives without direct armed conflict.", "Belvar's task-group mandate lapses after this turn; confirming its stand-down avoids escalation and protects the shipping both economies depend on."], "status": "adjudicating", "turn": 4}
INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=note data={"actor_id": "arkania", "created_at": "2026-09-12T14:10:20.064146", "id": "44b62fc5-1671-4610-be19-49458a7d7e49", "text": "Turn 4 argument submitted: consolidate the joint Strait Transit Authority as settled - Arkania as accountable executive operator under the joint oversight council, Strait open, fees on non-Arkanian shipping fund the authority, Cestian toll-free exemption, Belvar task group stands down without conflict. Belvar has accepted the joint framework as settled and pivoted to a civilian port cooperation + insurance underwriting (peaceful foothold), dropping the rotating-operator demand. Cestia backs me. Core objectives largely achieved: Arkanian scheduling authority (as operator under council), fee funding, no war. Next: hold the settlement, keep Strait open, avoid escalation. If Belvar reopens the operator question, hold firm; reserve mobilisation (needs 2 turns) remains quiet leverage but avoid direct war.", "visibility": "private"}
