INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia formally ratifies and consolidates the settled Northern Strait regime and the civilian port cooperation as the durable, final framework, reaffirming its firm red line against any foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "desired_effect": "The settled Northern Strait regime endures as the consolidated, operating framework: the joint Strait Transit Authority's oversight council (Belvar, Cestia, Arkania and a neutral chair) retains all policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority; the Strait remains open to all commercial shipping; Cestian-flagged vessels retain their standing toll-free exemption; and the strictly civilian, Cestian-controlled port cooperation (logistics, maintenance, coordination) remains time-limited and renewable only by Cestia, in no way constituting or facilitating a foreign military presence. Cestian territory continues to host no foreign military presence, and the settlement holds through negotiation with both powers constructively engaged.", "id": "e752f4f8-3a0d-4d94-8f98-85d98c6093f3", "pros": ["Locks in all three Cestian objectives: no foreign military on Cestian soil, toll-free Cestian-flagged passage, and a stable coalition government. The red line is preserved and made durable.", "Consolidates the joint, neutral character of the regime so no single state controls transit, keeping the council's real authority intact and the waterway open for everyone.", "Gives Belvar a credible, non-military Strait guarantee (civilian port cooperation + insurance underwriting) without a permanent fleet or open-ended deployment, removing the pressure for any military presence.", "Keeps both powers peacefully and constructively engaged, preventing Cestia from becoming their battlefield and sustaining the negotiated, non-escalatory settlement.", "Reinforces the standing toll-free exemption for Cestian-flagged shipping, which underpins the grain economy and the coalition's political support."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 4}
INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=note data={"actor_id": "cestia", "created_at": "2026-09-12T14:13:37.174611", "id": "19d74b13-b978-40d9-800d-dc678010aa99", "text": "Turn 4 argument (e752f4f8): Formally ratified and consolidated the settled Northern Strait regime + civilian port cooperation as the durable final framework, reaffirming the red line against any foreign military presence. Desired effect locks in: joint council authority, open Strait, standing toll-free Cestian-flagged exemption, strictly civilian Cestian-controlled port cooperation (time-limited, renewable only by Cestia, non-military), and no foreign military on Cestian soil. All three objectives secured. Settlement durable with both powers engaged; Belvar task group stood down, tensions eased. No further messages needed this phase.", "visibility": "private"}
