INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Belvar formally ratifies the consolidated Northern Strait settlement as the durable, final operating framework: the joint Strait Transit Authority with the joint oversight council (Belvar, Cestia, Arkania, neutral chair) holding all policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority; Arkania serving only as accountable executive operator of day-to-day scheduling under the council, subject to periodic review and a rotating chair; the Strait open to all commercial shipping with Cestian-flagged vessels retaining their standing toll-free exemption; the strictly civilian, Cestian-controlled port cooperation (logistics, maintenance, coordination, time-limited and renewable only by Cestia) and the grain-route insurance underwriting in place; and Belvar's task group stood down with no open-ended deployment.", "actor_id": "belvar", "budget_slot": 1, "desired_effect": "The Northern Strait settlement is locked in as the durable, final operating framework with all parties constructively engaged: no single state (including Arkania) holds authority over transit because the joint oversight council holds all real policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority; Belvar holds a standing, non-military Strait guarantee through the civilian Cestian-controlled port cooperation and grain-route insurance underwriting; and Belvar's task group remains stood down with no open-ended deployment, keeping the Strait open and Cestian-flagged shipping toll-free.", "id": "9f04559c-797b-4038-b462-9e3c831293d7", "pros": ["The joint oversight council holds all policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority, so no single state \u2014 including Arkania \u2014 controls transit, satisfying Belvar's core commitment to prevent Arkanian authority over the Strait.", "The strictly civilian, Cestian-controlled port cooperation and grain-route insurance underwriting give Belvar a standing, peaceful foothold that makes its Strait guarantee credible without a permanent fleet, addressing the naval-access objective within Cestia's red line.", "The task group stands down and no open-ended deployment is required, satisfying Belvar's objective to avoid an open-ended commitment while the mandate lapses as planned.", "Cestia and Arkania have both ratified the consolidated framework; Belvar's ratification completes the durable settlement and locks in the operating regime, preventing any reversion to unilateral control.", "The settlement keeps the Strait open to all commercial shipping with Cestian-flagged toll-free passage, preserving regional stability and the credibility of Belvar's guarantee."], "status": "adjudicating", "turn": 5}
