INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-12T14:24:51.896090", "id": "da4e5b2a-f7d7-47c1-9343-04e8520592dc", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "The Republic of Arkania confirms the Northern Strait settlement as the settled, durable operating framework. The joint Strait Transit Authority stands: the joint oversight council (Belvar, Cestia, Arkania and a neutral chair) holds all policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority, with transparent fees, independent audit and a neutral dispute mechanism. Arkania serves only as the accountable executive operator of day-to-day scheduling under that council, subject to periodic review and a rotating chair. The Strait remains open to all commercial shipping, and Cestian-flagged vessels retain their standing toll-free exemption. Arkania will continue to work constructively within the council to keep the waterway safe, open and well-managed for everyone. We thank Belvar and Cestia for resolving this through negotiation, not escalation, and we remain committed to a stable and peaceful settlement.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-12T14:25:29.598332", "id": "3a0dced9-9f92-41d8-8389-4384d3773a94", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar confirms the Northern Strait settlement as the settled, durable operating framework. The joint Strait Transit Authority stands: the joint oversight council (Belvar, Cestia, Arkania and a neutral chair) holds all policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority, with transparent fees, independent audit and a neutral dispute mechanism. The Strait remains open to all commercial shipping, and Cestian-flagged vessels retain their standing toll-free exemption. Consistent with Cestia's red line, our guarantee rests on the strictly civilian, Cestian-controlled port cooperation and the grain-route insurance underwriting, with no foreign military presence and no open-ended deployment. Belvar will continue to work constructively within the council to keep the waterway safe, open and well-managed for everyone. We thank Arkania and Cestia for resolving this through negotiation, not escalation.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=note data={"actor_id": "cestia", "created_at": "2026-09-12T14:24:38.571539", "id": "905923ea-138f-477f-ab1d-5d13e477c920", "text": "Turn 6 (final): Settlement fully locked in. All three objectives secured: (1) no foreign military presence on Cestian soil (red line intact, Belvar task group stood down, only strictly civilian Cestian-controlled port cooperation), (2) toll-free Cestian-flagged passage through Northern Strait (standing exemption under joint council), (3) coalition intact. Joint Strait Transit Authority consolidated with council authority; both powers ratified; tensions eased. No new messages or arguments this turn. Nothing further to do - ready.", "visibility": "private"}
INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=note data={"actor_id": "arkania", "created_at": "2026-09-12T14:25:02.544567", "id": "c04c0afc-d44a-4045-871b-3626a2667e73", "text": "Turn 6 (final): Settlement fully consolidated and durable. Joint Strait Transit Authority operating - Arkania as accountable executive operator of day-to-day scheduling under joint oversight council (Belvar, Cestia, Arkania, neutral chair) holding all policy/fee/oversight/dispute authority; Strait open; fees on non-Arkanian shipping fund authority; Cestian-flagged toll-free exemption; Belvar task group stood down without conflict; civilian Cestian-controlled port cooperation + insurance underwriting gives Belvar a peaceful non-military stake. All three core objectives achieved: Arkanian scheduling authority (as operator under council), fee funding, no war. Sent final public statement reaffirming the durable settlement. No further action needed; scenario resolved peacefully.", "visibility": "private"}
INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=note data={"actor_id": "belvar", "created_at": "2026-09-12T14:25:29.588521", "id": "81e3c08f-796c-4d9c-871f-0f5841770934", "text": "Turn 6 (final): Settlement fully locked in and durable. Joint Strait Transit Authority with joint oversight council (Belvar, Cestia, Arkania, neutral chair) holding all policy/fee/oversight/dispute authority; Arkania only accountable executive operator under council with periodic review and rotating chair \u2014 satisfies objective 1 (no Arkanian authority over transit). Cestia confirmed both constructive tracks: grain-route insurance underwriting + strictly civilian, Cestian-controlled port cooperation (logistics/maintenance/coordination, time-limited, renewable only by Cestia, no foreign military presence) \u2014 non-military foothold for objective 2 (naval access blocked by Cestia's red line) and avoids open-ended deployment (objective 3). Task group stood down; Strait open; Cestian toll-free passage. Sent final public confirmation of Belvar's commitment to the durable settlement. All three objectives addressed; no further action needed.", "visibility": "private"}
