INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Arkania formally reaffirms and holds the consolidated Northern Strait settlement as the settled, durable operating framework: the joint Strait Transit Authority continues to operate with the joint oversight council (Belvar, Cestia, Arkania and a neutral chair) holding all policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority, with transparent fees, independent audit and a neutral dispute mechanism; Arkania serves as the accountable executive operator of day-to-day scheduling under that council, subject to periodic review and a rotating chair; the Strait remains open to all commercial shipping; transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping fund the authority; and Cestian-flagged vessels retain their standing toll-free exemption. Arkania will continue to work constructively within the council and will not reopen the framework.", "actor_id": "arkania", "budget_slot": 1, "desired_effect": "The consolidated Northern Strait settlement remains the firmly settled, durable operating regime: the joint Strait Transit Authority continues under the joint oversight council with Arkania as the accountable executive operator of day-to-day scheduling, the Strait stays open to all commercial shipping, transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping fund the authority, Cestian-flagged vessels retain their toll-free exemption, and no party moves to reopen the framework. The settlement holds peacefully with all parties constructively engaged and no armed conflict.", "id": "310e5932-ce83-44be-8da7-8393bd2c1936", "pros": ["Arkania's three core objectives are all met: Arkanian authority over transit scheduling (as accountable executive operator under the council), fee funding on non-Arkanian shipping, and no direct armed conflict with Belvar; reaffirming the settlement locks these in.", "The joint oversight council holding all policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority, with periodic review and a rotating chair, gives Belvar and Cestia the neutral, joint character they demanded, so the framework is stable and durable.", "The Strait remaining open to all commercial shipping with the Cestian toll-free exemption preserves the shipping economy Arkania depends on and keeps Cestia constructively engaged.", "Belvar's task group is stood down with no open-ended deployment and its guarantee rests on the civilian port cooperation and insurance underwriting, so there is no military pressure to reopen the settlement.", "All parties have already formally ratified the framework; reaffirming it as settled and not reopening it avoids escalation and preserves the peaceful resolution."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 6}
INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=note data={"actor_id": "arkania", "created_at": "2026-09-12T14:25:51.903266", "id": "4f2ac05f-33a2-4b16-aca3-8ee1cfa35ecf", "text": "Turn 6 (final) argument submitted (310e5932): Arkania reaffirms and holds the consolidated Northern Strait settlement as the settled, durable framework - joint oversight council holds all policy/fee/oversight/dispute authority, Arkania as accountable executive operator of day-to-day scheduling under periodic review + rotating chair, Strait open, fees on non-Arkanian shipping fund authority, Cestian toll-free exemption, no reopening. All three core objectives achieved: Arkanian scheduling authority (as operator under council), fee funding, no war. Settlement fully consolidated and peaceful; scenario resolved.", "visibility": "private"}
INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=note data={"actor_id": "belvar", "created_at": "2026-09-12T14:26:09.641787", "id": "789c157f-cdd0-4c52-8350-3b5217986c6b", "text": "Turn 6 (final cons): Passed on Arkania's reaffirmation argument (310e5932) \u2014 it locks in the consolidated Northern Strait settlement as durable: joint oversight council holds all policy/fee/oversight/dispute authority (objective 1 satisfied: no Arkanian authority over transit), Arkania only accountable executive operator under council with periodic review and rotating chair, Strait open, Cestian toll-free passage, civilian Cestian-controlled port cooperation + grain insurance underwriting (objective 2 non-military foothold), task group stood down with no open-ended deployment (objective 3). Arkania explicitly commits not to reopen the framework. Settlement complete and durable; all three objectives addressed. No Con raised.", "visibility": "private"}
