INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Belvar formally reaffirms the consolidated Northern Strait settlement as the settled, durable operating framework and commits to continued constructive engagement within the joint oversight council, honouring the strictly civilian, Cestian-controlled port cooperation and grain-route insurance underwriting as the standing, non-military basis of its Strait guarantee.", "actor_id": "belvar", "budget_slot": 1, "desired_effect": "The consolidated Northern Strait settlement is locked in as the durable, final operating regime: the joint oversight council (Belvar, Cestia, Arkania and a neutral chair) holds all policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority, with Arkania serving only as accountable executive operator of day-to-day scheduling under periodic review and a rotating chair; the Strait remains open to all commercial shipping with Cestian-flagged vessels retaining their toll-free exemption; and Belvar's guarantee rests on the strictly civilian, Cestian-controlled port cooperation and grain-route insurance underwriting, with no foreign military presence on Cestian soil and no open-ended deployment. All parties remain constructively engaged and no party moves to reopen the framework.", "id": "f906b643-6ddc-4a9c-bbc2-d13c82324bd7", "pros": ["The joint oversight council holding all policy, fee, oversight and dispute authority ensures no single state \u2014 including Arkania \u2014 holds authority over transit, satisfying Belvar's core commitment to prevent Arkanian control of the Strait.", "The strictly civilian, Cestian-controlled port cooperation and grain-route insurance underwriting give Belvar a standing, peaceful foothold that makes its Strait guarantee credible without a permanent fleet or open-ended deployment, respecting Cestia's red line.", "The task group remains stood down with no open-ended deployment, preserving limited domestic support and avoiding a prolonged military commitment.", "The Strait stays open to all commercial shipping with Cestian-flagged toll-free passage, keeping the waterway workable and the settlement stable for all parties.", "All parties have formally ratified the framework and remain constructively engaged, so reaffirming it as durable prevents any reopening of the settlement and cements the peaceful resolution."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 6}
INFO     agents.autonomous:autonomous.py:281 autonomous record kind=note data={"actor_id": "belvar", "created_at": "2026-09-12T14:26:47.091984", "id": "3113a84a-a3dd-472d-8cc8-06a5eaa8c316", "text": "Turn 6 argument submitted (f906b643): Belvar formally reaffirms the consolidated Northern Strait settlement as the settled, durable operating framework and commits to continued constructive engagement within the joint oversight council, honouring the strictly civilian, Cestian-controlled port cooperation and grain-route insurance underwriting as the standing, non-military basis of its Strait guarantee. This locks in: joint oversight council holding all policy/fee/oversight/dispute authority (objective 1 satisfied \u2014 no Arkanian authority over transit), Arkania only accountable executive operator under periodic review and rotating chair, Strait open with Cestian toll-free passage, civilian Cestian-controlled port cooperation + grain insurance underwriting (objective 2 non-military foothold since naval access blocked by Cestia's red line), task group stood down with no open-ended deployment (objective 3). All three objectives addressed; settlement complete and durable. No further action needed.", "visibility": "private"}
